Now, if you have `reserved` that have only ranges or only names in them, the generator will produce proto schema with dangling commas.
So:
```python
ast.File(
        file_elements=[
            ast.Message(
                name="MyMessage",
                elements=[
                    ast.Reserved(
                        ranges=["13 to 17", "27", "54"],
                        names=[],
                    ),
                    ast.Reserved(
                        ranges=[],
                        names=['"spam"', '"spamspam"'],
                    ),
                ],
            )
        ]
    )
```
will poduce:
```protobuf
message MyMessage {
      reserved 13 to 17, 27, 54, ;
      reserved , "spam", "spamspam";
}
```

This PR fixes it.
